{"_id":"68ecda42166b018f83df9bb0","roadmapSlug":"devops","nodeId":"Kumwd6XOlEMeDohDH0q9P","description":"# Salt\n\nSalt is an open-source configuration management and remote execution tool. It uses a push and pull model to manage and automate the configuration of servers and applications. Salt allows you to define the desired state of your infrastructure and then automatically enforce that state across your systems.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Salt Docs","url":"https://docs.saltproject.io/salt/install-guide/en/latest/","_id":"6a7f4a60cb44947debcf63ef"},{"type":"official","title":"Salt in 10 Minutes","url":"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/walkthrough.html","_id":"6a7f4a60cb44947debcf63f0"},{"type":"opensource","title":"Salt","url":"https://github.com/saltstack/salt","_id":"6a7f4a60cb44947debcf63f1"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-13T10:53:54.283Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:28.461Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/devops/content/Kumwd6XOlEMeDohDH0q9P.md"}